WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.100
This is the feature grid.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.700
The same questions asked of all three.

3
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:15.000
Freshroute plans delivery routes. Barnwise states it does not.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.800
A tick is a stated yes, a cross a stated no.

5
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:23.900
A question mark is neither.

6
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:28.500
It means the pages were read and nobody said either way.

7
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.600
A triangle is a claim by a rival.

8
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.800
Croptally says Freshroute does this. Freshroute does not say it.

9
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.400
Recent changes are next.
